    "Expanded form stretches a number out to show the value of each digit.",
    "45 in expanded form is 40 + 5.",
    "The tens digit becomes a tens number (4 → 40), and the ones digit stays the same (5).",
    "It works backwards too: 60 + 3 = 63!"
